      "needsReview": false
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.25-p005",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তাহলে প্রশ্নানুসারে, $n(S) = 50$, $n(E) = 35$, $n(E \\cap B) = 25$ এবং $S = E \\cup B$। মনে করি, $n(B) = x$।",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n(S) = 50",
        "n(E) = 35",
        "n(E \\cap B) = 25",
        "S = E \\cup B",
        "n(B) = x"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 21,
      "pdfPageEnd": 21,
      "printedPageStart": 16,
      "printedPageEnd": 16,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.25-p006",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "তাহলে, $n(S) = n(E \\cup B) = n(E) + n(B) - n(E \\cap B)$ থেকে পাই,",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "n(S) = n(E \\cup B) = n(E) + n(B) - n(E \\cap B)"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 21,
      "pdfPageEnd": 21,
      "printedPageStart": 16,
      "printedPageEnd": 16,
      "reviewReasons": [
        "verify-formula"
      ],
      "needsReview": true
    },
    {
      "id": "higher-math-9-10-bn-c01-t1.25-p007",
      "kind": "text",
      "section": null,
      "caption": null,
      "body": "$50 = 35 + x - 25$ বা, $x = 50 - 35 + 25 = 40$ অর্থাৎ, $n(B) = 40$",
      "image": null,
      "formulas": [
        "50 = 35 + x - 25",
        "x = 50 - 35 + 25 = 40",
        "n(B) = 40"
      ],
      "pdfPageStart": 21,
      "pdfPageEnd": 21,
